I can't believe the great character I had early in the game!  I started
out as an Archaeologist (sp?) who was Experience level 3 by Dungeon
level 2.  I had decent hit points, which seemed VERY strange considering
the character type I was using.  Then I got into a tool shop on level 2.
I saw 2 lamps side by side, named one of them so I could see if they
were the same type or not.  Lo and behold they were the same, so I
figured that they would _have_ to be normal lamps.  

WRONG!

I tried rubbing one of them anyway, and I couldn't believe it when I saw
the message "a puff of smoke appears".  That means 2 MAGIC LAMPS!  And I
hadn't even finished checking out the shop yet!  Immediately I bought
one and rubbed it again... I decided to try for decent armor right away,
so I wished for "blessed +2 gray dragon scale mail"...  But when I hit
the enter key to enter my wish, I just got my system prompt!  AUGH!  And
it gets worse!  I noticed that the prompt I got was the prompt from my
local system, not even on Nyx, where I play the game!  

I quickly telnetted back over to nyx, and I was really relieved when I
found that the game apparently got saved when I was kicked off.
However, now the genie was just wandering around... and I didn't have
the armor... I had lost my wish!!  And then I did the one REALLY stupid
thing; I tried talking to the genie.  He got mad at me, and two moves
later I was dead... still holding the magic lamp.  I nearly cried...  
